if {mouseKey2} == false:
	A takoyaki stand. There’s a distinct cheese smell.
	Call out?
	- Yes
		audio "res://sound/sfx/wormcall.wav"
		[wait time="2.0"]
		...
		if {mouseKey} == false:
			unknown: ..uhh, no habla español.. I mean, erm inglés. No habla inglés.
			unknown: ...come back later! Or earlier!... or actually... later!
		else:
			unknown: Oh! A customer!... I mean... I'm not open!
			unknown: Was just testing the pan! And the timing!... And the timing of the timing!
			- I'll wait it smells really good already!
				unknown: ...Re-really? O..okay... I can do one batch
				set {mouseKey2} = true
			- Are you open yet?
				unknown: N-no...
			- Do you want help?
				unknown: No no no. coo many tooks, I mean... too many cooks
	- No
else:
	unknown: I think I’ve got it this time…
	unknown: I just don’t want it to be wrong when someone’s watching.
	- You’re doing great! Don’t worry!
		unknown: I am worried!!
	- You don’t have to rush. I’m here when you’re ready.
		unknown: ...okay
		[wait time="5.0"]
		unknown: Okay! I think they're done!
		set {mouseOpen} = true
	- Maybe flip it earlier?
		unknown: No--! that's not how I practiced it!
[signal arg="dialogue_end"]